<title>USA: Kuhlman Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $0.37.</title>
<headline>Kuhlman Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Ga. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.37		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net		 5,129		    3,393</p>
<p> Sales	     119,198		  108,561</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  13,838		   13,227</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.89		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net		 12,279		   4,355</p>
<p> Sales	     334,855		  318,301</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  13,872		   13,181</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Kuhlman Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the gain in third quarter 1996 results was mostly due to Kuhlman's positive gains in major markets and margin improvement across key product lines.</p>
<p>Net income for the first nine months of 1995 included one- time transaction costs of about $5.6 million associated with its merger with Schwitzer in the second quarter 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
